    },
    {
      "id": "decpay-error-after-good-members",
      "fn": "eio.decodePayload",
      "args": [
        {
          "encoded": "4a\u001e4b\u001e4c\u001ezz\u001e4d"
        }
      ],
      "upstreamFn": "decodePayload",
      "goFn": "engineio.DecodePayload",
      "note": "upstream stops at the first bad member and returns the earlier packets plus an error packet; the port returns an error for the whole body. Both refuse the body, which is what the transport layer acts on: both runners report failure."
    },
    {
